          "letter": "",
          "english": "In 2007, Nokia accounted for more than 40% of mobile phone sales __(27)__ . But consumers' preferences were already __(28)__ toward touch-screen smartphones. With the introduction of Apple's iPhone in the middle of that year, Nokia's market share __(29)__ rapidly and revenue plunged. By the end of 2013, Nokia had sold its phone business to Microsoft.",
