          "letter": "",
          "english": "What sealed Nokia's fate was a series of decisions made by Stephen Elop in his position as CEO, which he __(30)__ in October 2010. Each day that Elop spent in charge of Nokia, the company's market value declined by $23 million, making him, by the numbers, one of the worst CEOs in history.",
